msgid ""
"django-compressor is no longer used, and the ``COMPRESS_*`` settings have "
"been removed."
msgstr ""

#: changes.rst:71
msgid ""
"Legal document styling is now provided through an overridable template "
"instead of Weblate's global stylesheet. See :ref:`legal-customization`."
msgstr ""

#: changes.rst:72
msgid ""
"When :setting:`VCS_RESTRICT_PRIVATE` is enabled, Mercurial and Subversion "
"repository hosts must be explicitly included in :setting:`VCS_ALLOW_HOSTS`; "
"Git over HTTPS and SSH enforces connection address pinning without an "
"allowlist entry."
