#: changes.rst:73
msgid ""
"Outbound HTTP proxy configuration is limited to the per-protocol environment "
"variables documented in :ref:`http-proxy`."
msgstr ""

#: changes.rst:74
msgid ""
"Git SSH validates configured ``HostName`` and ``Port`` destinations before "
"connecting; administrator SSH configuration remains trusted, "
"and :setting:`SSH_EXTRA_ARGS` can override connection routing and address "
"pinning."
msgstr ""

#: changes.rst:75
msgid ""
"Git LFS object transfers are unsupported and disabled for Weblate-managed "
"repositories; LFS-tracked files remain pointer files."
msgstr ""

#: changes.rst:76
msgid ""
"The project and component ``credits`` REST API endpoints and their "
"``credits_url`` response fields have been replaced by scoped ``reports`` "
"endpoints and ``reports_url``. Credits report generation is now "
"asynchronous; clients need to submit a ``credits`` report, follow the "
"returned task URL, and fetch the completed report. See :http:post:`/api/"
"reports/`."
msgstr ""

