msgstr ""
":ref:`check-reused` is இல்லை longer triggered க்கு மொழிகள் with a ஒற்றை plural "
"form."

#: changes/v5.rst:2177
msgid "WebP is now supported for :ref:`screenshots`."
msgstr "WebP இப்போது :ref:`screenshots` க்கு துணைபுரிகிறது."

#: changes/v5.rst:2178
msgid ""
"Avoid duplicate notification when a user is subscribed to overlapping scopes."
